{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"sc59761d33514dfaf","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7486-893726ccadf7259114a2","text":"[开拓者]，在吗！！！！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-e3e106da8d7cb941376b","text":"怎么这么着急？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-4987dfe1bb36aac496bb","text":"发生什么大事了？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-ce52abeda57687507f1c","text":"莫慌","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-cdc1c8bd789252c09e91","text":"悠着点，慢慢说？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-6321a7030d611036bd6f","text":"超级无敌紧急的事","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-e7975f5f4d169e306c96","text":"帕姆都不敢想","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-36186f9c60d2ac235a24","text":"列车时隔很久才会来一次的大扫除之日居然就要到了啊啊啊啊啊啊","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-7d2535d6684b47134bdd","text":"……啊？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-94d52e5df89284208354","text":"我懂了","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-0dce15be793c473d34c8","text":"你想喊我回去一起做清洁","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-6a3c2ab7fc37408b53d1","text":"不过如果[开拓者]乘客愿意帮忙帕姆也很欢迎！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-fe21d4243683bfb740c9","text":"我们马上准备前往最近的洗车星","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-f20f82ad6c2c2d1d1b74","text":"你什么时候有空回来看看帕","speaker":"帕姆"}]}
